@stackline/pg-types

This package is an independently maintained fork derived from pg-types,
originally developed by Brian M. Carlson and contributors.

Upstream source: https://github.com/brianc/node-pg-types
Public compatibility baseline: pg-types 2.2.0, commit
d9d9dfb87eb50914043cbc178c301b7dd3b0c50d.

Parser source from the exact historical runtime dependencies is maintained
inside this package. The original notices are preserved in licenses/ and
listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. Stackline is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the node-postgres maintainers.
